{# BJJ Transition Template V3 - Jinja2 #}
{# Generates markdown from TEMPLATE.json data with auto-generated schema markup #}
{# A/B Testing: variant-a-show/variant-b-hide CSS classes for section testing #}

---
title: "{{metadata.title}}"
description: "{{metadata.description}}"
---


<!-- Schema Markup - Auto-generated from JSON -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "HowTo",
  "name": "How to Execute {{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}} in BJJ",
  "description": "Step-by-step guide for {{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}} from {{metadata.starting_position}} to {{metadata.ending_position}}.",
  "step": [
    {%- for step in execution_steps[:8] %}
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "{{step.action}}",
      "text": "{{step.description}}",
      "position": {{loop.index}}
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ],
  "tool": ["BJJ Gi or No-Gi attire", "Training partner", "Mat space"],
  "totalTime": "PT5M"
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for qa in knowledge_assessment[:6] %}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "{{qa.question}}",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "{{qa.answer}}"
      }
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "{{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}}",
  "description": "{{metadata.description}}",
  "url": "https://bjjgraph.org/Transitions/{{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip().replace(' ', '-')}}",
  "isPartOf": {
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "BJJ Graph",
    "url": "https://bjjgraph.org"
  }
}
</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/"},
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Transitions", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Transitions/"},
    {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "{{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}}", "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Transitions/{{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip().replace(' ', '-')}}"}
  ]
}
</script>


# {{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}}
{% for tag in metadata.tags %}#{{tag}} {% endfor %}

> **Quick Answer**: {{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}} transitions from [[{{metadata.starting_position}}]] to [[{{metadata.ending_position}}]]. Success rates: Beginner {{metadata.success_rates.beginner}}%, Intermediate {{metadata.success_rates.intermediate}}%, Advanced {{metadata.success_rates.advanced}}%.

<section id="overview" class="content-section">

## What is {{metadata.title.split('|')[0].strip()}}?

{{overview}}

**Starting Position**: [[{{metadata.starting_position}}]]
**Ending Position**: [[{{metadata.ending_position}}]]
**Success Rates**: Beginner {{metadata.success_rates.beginner}}%, Intermediate {{metadata.success_rates.intermediate}}%, Advanced {{metadata.success_rates.advanced}}%

</section>

<section id="key-principles" class="content-section">

## What Are the Key Principles?
{% for principle in key_principles -%}
- {{principle}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="setup-requirements" class="content-section">

## What Do You Need Before Starting This Technique?
{% for req in setup_requirements -%}
- {{req}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="execution-steps" class="content-section">

## How to Execute This Technique Step-by-Step
{% for step in execution_steps -%}
{{step.step_number}}. **{{step.action}}**: {{step.description}}{% if step.timing %} (Timing: {{step.timing}}){% endif %}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="common-counters" class="content-section">

## How Does the Opponent Counter This Technique?
{% for counter in common_counters -%}
- **{{counter.counter}}** (Effectiveness: {{counter.effectiveness}}){% if counter.your_response %} - Your Response: {{counter.your_response}}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="common-errors" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## What Mistakes Do Practitioners Make With This Technique?
{% for error in common_errors -%}
- **Error**: {{error.error}}
  - **Consequence**: {{error.consequence}}
  - **Correction**: {{error.correction}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="training-progressions" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## How to Train This Technique Progressively
{% for progression in training_progressions -%}
**{{progression.phase}}** - {{progression.focus}}
{{progression.description}}
{% if progression.resistance_level %}(Resistance: {{progression.resistance_level}}){% endif %}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="variants-and-adaptations" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## What Are the Variations of This Technique?
{% for variant in variants_and_adaptations -%}
**{{variant.variant_name}}**: {{variant.description}}{% if variant.when_to_use %} (When to use: {{variant.when_to_use}}){% endif %}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="knowledge-assessment" class="content-section">

## How Well Do You Understand This Technique?
{% for qa in knowledge_assessment -%}
**Q{{loop.index}}**: {{qa.question}}
**A**: {{qa.answer}}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="safety-considerations" class="content-section">

## What Are the Safety Considerations?

{{safety_considerations}}

</section>

<section id="position-integration" class="content-section">

## How Does This Fit Into Your Overall Game?

{{position_integration}}

</section>

<section id="related-content" class="content-section">

## Which Techniques Are Related?

{% for item in related_content -%}
- [[{{item.name}}]] - {{item.relationship}}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="expert-insights" class="content-section expert-insight">

## What Do the Experts Say About This Technique?
- **Danaher System**: {{expert_insights.danaher}}
- **Gordon Ryan**: {{expert_insights.gordon_ryan}}
- **Eddie Bravo**: {{expert_insights.eddie_bravo}}

</section>
